  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>2015년 5월 29일부터 날짜 순서대로 입니다. <br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991A9C445D02037D28\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150529.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_991A9C445D02037D289683\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99673A445D02037F24\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150530.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_99673A445D02037F243399\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996F81445D0203802F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150531.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_996F81445D0203802F4CE5\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99957E445D02038222\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150601.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_99957E445D02038222C3D3\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996380445D02038330\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150602.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_996380445D020383301DAE\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CCA3445D0203852B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150603.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_99CCA3445D0203852BD977\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C8F8445D0203862B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150604.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_99C8F8445D0203862B7AE3\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99968D485D02038833\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150605.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_99968D485D020388334923\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997D2E485D02038929\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150606.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_997D2E485D020389291F3A\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998C1D485D02038B34\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150607.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_998C1D485D02038B341A67\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9933F2485D02038D2C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150608.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_9933F2485D02038D2C1930\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993394485D02038E2C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20150609.gif\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_993394485D02038E2CED2D\"/></p><p><br></p><p>지금은 흑점수 극소기라 흑점이 안보이네요 </p><p><br></p><p>다행히 2015년 5월 말에 12일동안 저장해둔 흑점 사진이 있어서 </p><p><br></p><p>태양의 자전이나 흑점에 대한 설명할때 사용햇어요 </p><p><br></p><p>2019년이 극소기인걸 보여주려고 </p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><a href=\"http://www.spaceweather.com/\">http://www.spaceweather.com/</a>&nbsp;</p><p>이 사이트에서 보여줬어요 </p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
